---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="BeLeaf — Our Synthetic Business" description="A fully-realised fictional company for testing, demos, and proving our approaches work">
  <article class="beleaf-page">
    <section class="hero-beleaf">
      <div class="beleaf-badge">🌿☕ Synthetic Business</div>
      <h1>Meet BeLeaf</h1>
      <p class="tagline">A mid-size tea & coffee supplier we built to prove our approaches work — before we ever touch your business.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-label">Why a Synthetic Business?</h2>
      <div class="intro-content">
        <p>
          Most consultants show you slides. We show you <strong>working systems</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          BeLeaf is a fully-realised fictional company with 149 employees, £18M revenue, 
          real org charts, real processes, and real problems. Every tool we build, 
          every framework we teach, every AI agent we deploy — we test it on BeLeaf first.
        </p>
        <div class="s-formula-banner">
          <span class="s-item simpler">Simpler</span>
          <span class="s-plus">+</span>
          <span class="s-item smarter">Smarter</span>
          <span class="s-plus">+</span>
          <span class="s-item speedier">Speedier</span>
          <span class="s-equals">=</span>
          <span class="s-item smilier">Smilier</span>
        </div>
        <p class="s-explanation">
          BeLeaf demonstrates how our integrated approach delivers all four — 
          because transformation only works when everything connects.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-label">Company at a Glance</h2>
      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-value">149</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Employees</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-value">£18.2M</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Revenue</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-value">87</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Products</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-value">4</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Locations</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="company-summary">
        <p>
          <strong>BeLeaf Ltd.</strong> is a Bristol-based tea & coffee supplier serving offices, 
          cafés, and direct consumers across Europe. Founded in 2012 by Marcus Chen and Priya Sharma, 
          they've grown from a garage startup to a thriving mid-market player — but they've hit a plateau.
        </p>
        <p class="tagline-quote">"Where quality brews"</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section challenges-section">
      <h2 class="section-label">Their Challenges = Your Challenges</h2>
      <p class="challenges-intro">BeLeaf's pain points map to our 5 tenets — and probably sound familiar:</p>
      
      <div class="challenge-grid">
        <div class="challenge-card">
          <div class="s-badge simpler">Simpler</div>
          <span class="tenet-tag">Clarity</span>
          <h4>"Great products, confusing range"</h4>
          <p>87 SKUs but customers don't know where to start. Product excellence gets lost in complexity.</p>
          <span class="person">Aisha Patel, CMO</span>
        </div>

        <div class="challenge-card">
          <div class="s-badge smarter">Smarter</div>
          <span class="tenet-tag">Insight</span>
          <h4>"Data everywhere, no insight"</h4>
          <p>3 years of customer data sitting unused. 4 systems that don't talk to each other.</p>
          <span class="person">Fatima Al-Hussein, Data Lead</span>
        </div>

        <div class="challenge-card">
          <div class="s-badge speedier">Speedier</div>
          <span class="tenet-tag">AI</span>
          <h4>"Should be using AI, haven't started"</h4>
          <p>Everyone's talking about AI but where do you actually begin? Analysis paralysis.</p>
          <span class="person">Priya Sharma, CTO</span>
        </div>

        <div class="challenge-card">
          <div class="s-badge smilier">Smilier</div>
          <span class="tenet-tag">Story</span>
          <h4>"Losing to dumber competitors"</h4>
          <p>Best coffee in the market but sales team can't articulate the difference.</p>
          <span class="person">Emma Rodriguez, VP Sales</span>
        </div>

        <div class="challenge-card full-width">
          <span class="tenet-tag">Growth</span>
          <h4>"Post-pandemic plateau, what's next?"</h4>
          <p>The boom masked structural issues. Now growth has stalled and the team is burning out.</p>
          <span class="person">Sarah Mitchell, CEO</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-label">What We're Testing at BeLeaf</h2>
      <div class="testing-grid">
        <a href="/rabbit-holes/agentic-overview/" class="test-card">
          <span class="test-icon">🤖</span>
          <h4>Agentic AI Dashboard</h4>
          <p>Multi-agent systems transforming 5 core processes</p>
          <span class="s-tag speedier">Speedier</span>
        </a>
        <div class="test-card coming-soon">
          <span class="test-icon">🌱</span>
          <h4>The Greenhouse</h4>
          <p>90-day diagnostic for human-centric transformation</p>
          <span class="s-tag smilier">Smilier</span>
          <span class="soon-badge">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="test-card coming-soon">
          <span class="test-icon">📊</span>
          <h4>Solution Stack</h4>
          <p>Simpler alternative to Business Model Canvas</p>
          <span class="s-tag simpler">Simpler</span>
          <span class="soon-badge">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="test-card coming-soon">
          <span class="test-icon">🔍</span>
          <h4>Zeitgeist</h4>
          <p>Knowledge graph connecting all business intelligence</p>
          <span class="s-tag smarter">Smarter</span>
          <span class="soon-badge">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section org-section">
      <h2 class="section-label">The Organisation</h2>
      <div class="org-visual">
        <div class="dept-row exec">
          <div class="dept-card">
            <span class="dept-count">4</span>
            <span class="dept-name">Executive Team</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dept-row">
          <div class="dept-card">
            <span class="dept-count">38</span>
            <span class="dept-name">Operations</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dept-card">
            <span class="dept-count">32</span>
            <span class="dept-name">Sales</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dept-card">
            <span class="dept-count">22</span>
            <span class="dept-name">Technology</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dept-row">
          <div class="dept-card">
            <span class="dept-count">18</span>
            <span class="dept-name">Marketing</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dept-card">
            <span class="dept-count">16</span>
            <span class="dept-name">Finance & HR</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dept-card">
            <span class="dept-count">15</span>
            <span class="dept-name">Customer Experience</span>
          </div>
          <div class="dept-card">
            <span class="dept-count">8</span>
            <span class="dept-name">Product</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section differentiator-section">
      <div class="differentiator-box">
        <h3>Why This Matters</h3>
        <p>
          Most consultants arrive, observe, and recommend. 
          <strong>We arrive having already built and tested the solution.</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          BeLeaf is our proof of work. When you see a demo, it's not a mock-up — 
          it's a system that works. When you hear a framework, it's not theory — 
          it's been stress-tested against real complexity.
        </p>
        <div class="s-formula-inline">
          <span class="s-item simpler">Simpler</span> documentation
          <span class="s-item smarter">Smarter</span> insights
          <span class="s-item speedier">Speedier</span> execution
          <span class="s-item smilier">Smilier</span> outcomes
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section cta-section">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <h3>See BeLeaf in Action</h3>
        <p>Experience how agentic AI transforms a real (fictional) business.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="/rabbit-holes/agentic-overview/" class="cta-button primary">Explore the Demo</a>
          <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com?subject=BeLeaf%20Demo%20Request" class="cta-button secondary">Request a Walkthrough</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="article-footer">
      <div class="related-links">
        <h4>Explore Related</h4>
        <a href="/rabbit-holes/agentic-overview/">Agentic AI Operations →</a>
        <a href="/ai/">AI Tenet →</a>
        <a href="/services/">How We Work →</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .beleaf-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-beleaf {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .beleaf-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(45, 80, 22, 0.3) 0%, rgba(74, 55, 40, 0.3) 100%);
    padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(45, 80, 22, 0.5);
  }

  .hero-beleaf h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-beleaf .tagline {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .intro-content p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* S-Formula Banner */
  .s-formula-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #111;
  }

  .s-item {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .s-item.simpler { background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.2); color: #2196F3; }
  .s-item.smarter { background: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.2); color: #9C27B0; }
  .s-item.speedier { background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.2); color: var(--accent); }
  .s-item.smilier { background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.2); color: #4CAF50; }

  .s-plus, .s-equals {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .s-explanation {
    text-align: center;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Stats Grid */
  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .stats-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .stat-value {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .company-summary {
    background: #0f0f0f;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #2D5016;
  }

  .company-summary p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .tagline-quote {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #2D5016 !important;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Challenges */
  .challenges-intro {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .challenge-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .challenge-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .challenge-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .challenge-card.full-width {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .s-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    right: 1rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .s-badge.simpler { background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.2); color: #2196F3; }
  .s-badge.smarter { background: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.2); color: #9C27B0; }
  .s-badge.speedier { background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.2); color: var(--accent); }
  .s-badge.smilier { background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.2); color: #4CAF50; }

  .tenet-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .challenge-card h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .challenge-card p {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .challenge-card .person {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* Testing Grid */
  .testing-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .testing-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .test-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
    position: relative;
  }

  .test-card:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .test-card.coming-soon {
    opacity: 0.6;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .test-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .test-card h4 {
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .test-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .s-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .s-tag.simpler { background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.2); color: #2196F3; }
  .s-tag.smarter { background: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.2); color: #9C27B0; }
  .s-tag.speedier { background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.2); color: var(--accent); }
  .s-tag.smilier { background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.2); color: #4CAF50; }

  .soon-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    right: 1rem;
    background: #333;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Org Visual */
  .org-visual {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .dept-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .dept-row.exec .dept-card {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .dept-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-left: 3px solid #333;
    min-width: 120px;
  }

  .dept-count {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .dept-name {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Differentiator */
  .differentiator-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.08) 0%, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.02) 100%);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .differentiator-box h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .differentiator-box p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .s-formula-inline {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .s-formula-inline .s-item {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-box {
    background: #111;
    padding: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #333;
  }

  .cta-box h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cta-box p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .cta-button {
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-button.primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
  }

  .cta-button.secondary {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* Footer */
  .article-footer {
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .related-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .related-links h4 {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .related-links a {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .related-links a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
</style>
